 .../server/compartments/StandingFix.java      | 184 +++++++++++++++
 .../provider/LocationProviderManager.java     | 216 +++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 493 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 services/core/java/com/android/server/compartments/StandingFix.java

